# Wattleflow documentation — staged publication.
#
# Decision 2026-10-03: the repository publishes the generic layer only, one
# record at a time. Everything is ignored unless it is listed below; a record
# enters publication by adding its own `!` line. Git history up to v0.0.5 is
# kept as it is (D-03, D-05) — nothing is rewritten.
#
# Consequence declared (D-11): published records cite files that are not yet
# published (sibling NFRQ, 05-METHODS, 06-ANALYSIS, 07-CHANGES). Those links
# do not resolve for the reader of the published edition until the cited
# record is admitted.

# --- Ignore everything ----------------------------------------------------
/*

# --- Repository essentials -------------------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/wattleflow.png

# --- Requirements: generic layer, admitted one by one ---------------------
!/requirements/
/requirements/*

!/requirements/01-HLRQ/
/requirements/01-HLRQ/*
!/requirements/01-HLRQ/HLRQ-01-GENERIC-LAYER.md

# v0.0.7: the whole FRQ register is admitted.
!/requirements/02-FRQ/

# Not yet admitted (v0.0.7): 03-NFRQ, 05-METHODS, 06-ANALYSIS, 07-CHANGES,
# blackwattle, dockers — covered by `/requirements/*` above.

# PlantUML and CSS styles included by every inline diagram and rendered page.
!/requirements/styles/

.gitignore
CLAUDE.md

.*
